TEXT -736 -1168 Left 2 ;Bypass path: in -> C11 -> Jbp -> out.  Effect path: fx -> C12 -> Jfx -> out.  Both channels biased at 4.5V.
TEXT -736 -1136 Left 2 ;Jbp is driven by ffB, Jfx by ffA. Gate drive: collector -> 1M -> 4.7n to gnd -> diode (anode at gate).
TEXT -736 -1088 Left 2 !B1 fx 0 V=1.2*tanh(4*V(in))
TEXT 320 -1200 Left 2 ;B1 = stand-in for the overdrive (clipped, louder) so bypass vs effect is easy to see
TEXT 320 -1064 Left 2 !.model JSW NJF(Vto=-1.2 Beta=2.5m Lambda=4m Rd=10 Rs=10 Cgs=5p Cgd=5p)
TEXT 320 -1104 Left 2 ;JSW: approximate low-pinch-off switching JFET (2SK30A / J201 class)
TEXT -288 664 Left 2 !.tran 0 1 0 20u startup
TEXT -288 696 Left 2 !.param Rc=56k
TEXT -80 696 Left 2 ;Collector resistors. 56k works; 10k raises the 'high' level from ~4.7V to ~7.7V for more gate headroom on hot signals
TEXT -288 728 Left 2 !S1 trig 0 swctl 0 FSW
TEXT -288 760 Left 2 !Vsw swctl 0 PULSE(0 1 0.5 1m 1m 100m 1 5)
TEXT -288 792 Left 2 !.model FSW SW(Ron=22 Roff=1G Vt=0.5)
TEXT -288 824 Left 2 ;Footswitch: momentary short to ground, 100 ms press once per second (at 0.5, 1.5, 2.5 ...)
TEXT 784 248 Left 2 !.meas TRAN pp0 PP V(vout) FROM 0.3 TO 0.45\n.meas TRAN pp1 PP V(vout) FROM 1.2 TO 1.45\n.meas TRAN pp2 PP V(vout) FROM 2.2 TO 2.45\n.meas TRAN pp3 PP V(vout) FROM 3.2 TO 3.45\n.meas TRAN pp4 PP V(vout) FROM 4.2 TO 4.45
TEXT 784 440 Left 2 !.meas TRAN ffa0 FIND V(ffa) AT=0.4\n.meas TRAN ffa1 FIND V(ffa) AT=1.4\n.meas TRAN ffb0 FIND V(ffb) AT=0.4\n.meas TRAN ffb1 FIND V(ffb) AT=1.4
